      "properties": {
        "entityId": "sui",
        "startDate": "0605-03-01",
        "endDate": "0610-12-31",
        "order": 3,
        "segmentType": "advance",
        "name": {
          "zh": "洛阳—淮安—江都—余杭（通济渠、邗沟、江南河）",
          "en": "Luoyang–Huai’an–Jiangdu–Yuhang (Tongji, Han and Jiangnan canals)"
        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "大业元年（605）三月发河南、淮北民夫百余万开通济渠，自洛阳西苑引谷、洛水入河，又自板渚引河水循汴水入淮；同年发淮南民夫十余万拓宽邗沟，自山阳（淮安）至扬子入江，八月完成，炀帝即乘龙舟下江都。大业六年（610）开江南河，自京口引江水至余杭，八百余里。原线止于淮安，线尾无后续；此处补江都、余杭两段。路线为示意。",
          "en": "In the third month of 605 over a million labourers from Henan and Huaibei dug the Tongji canal from Luoyang’s Western Garden to the Yellow River and on via the old Bian channel to the Huai; in the same year over 100,000 men from Huainan widened the Han canal from Shanyang (Huai’an) to the Yangtze at Yangzi. Work finished in the eighth month and the emperor sailed to Jiangdu. In 610 the Jiangnan canal was opened from Jingkou to Yuhang, over 800 li. The former line stopped at Huai’an with no follow-through; Jiangdu and Yuhang are now added. The line is schematic."
        },
        "extensions": {
          "precision": "schematic"
        }
      }
    },
