      "properties": {
        "entityId": "sui",
        "startDate": "0612-01-01",
        "endDate": "0612-08-31",
        "order": 4,
        "segmentType": "counterattack",
        "name": {
          "zh": "涿郡—辽东",
          "en": "Zhuojun–Liaodong"
        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "大业八年（612）正月，炀帝自江都经永济渠北上，至涿郡临朔宫，诏天下兵会涿郡，号称一百一十三万；二月渡辽水，围辽东城，久攻不下，六月以后诸路溃败，七月撤军。原线线头涿郡无前置，现由永济渠段承接。路线为示意。",
          "en": "In the first month of 612 Emperor Yang came north from Jiangdu by the Yongji canal to the Linshuo palace at Zhuojun and ordered the empire’s troops to assemble there, claiming 1,130,000 men. In the second month the army crossed the Liao and besieged Liaodong city; the siege failed, the columns collapsed after the sixth month and the army withdrew in the seventh. The former route began at Zhuojun without a precedent, now supplied by the Yongji canal leg. The line is schematic."
        },
        "extensions": {
          "precision": "schematic"
        }
      }
    },
