      "properties": {
        "entityId": "tang",
        "startDate": "0848-01-01",
        "endDate": "0861-03-31",
        "order": 24,
        "segmentType": "counterattack",
        "name": {
          "zh": "沙州—瓜州—肃州—甘州—凉州（归义军收复河西）",
          "en": "Shazhou–Guazhou–Suzhou–Ganzhou–Liangzhou (Guiyi Army recovers Hexi)"
        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "大中二年（848）张议潮在沙州起兵，逐吐蕃守将，同年收复瓜州，遣使绕道天德入奏；大中四年（850）收复伊州，大中五年（851）前后收复肃州、甘州等，八月遣兄张议潭献十一州图籍，十一月唐置归义军。大中十二年（858）起张淮深率蕃汉兵七千东征凉州，咸通二年（861）克之，河陇故地尽复。原线止于瓜州，线尾无后续；此处补肃、甘、凉三州。路线为示意。",
          "en": "In 848 Zhang Yichao rose at Shazhou, expelled the Tibetan commanders and recovered Guazhou the same year, sending envoys to the court via Tiande. Yizhou fell in 850 and Suzhou and Ganzhou around 851; in the eighth month his brother Zhang Yitan presented the registers of eleven prefectures and in the eleventh month the Guiyi Army was established. From 858 Zhang Huaishen led 7,000 Tibetan and Chinese troops east against Liangzhou, which fell in 861, completing the recovery of the Hexi–Longyou lands. The former line stopped at Guazhou with no follow-through; Suzhou, Ganzhou and Liangzhou are now added. The line is schematic."
        },
        "extensions": {
          "precision": "schematic"
        }
      }
