        "startDate": "0868-07-01",
        "endDate": "0869-09-30",
        "order": 25,
        "segmentType": "counterattack",
        "name": {
          "zh": "桂州—徐州",
          "en": "Guizhou–Xuzhou"
        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "咸通四年（863）唐廷为援安南在徐泗募兵二千，分八百人戍守桂州，约定三年一换；至咸通九年（868）已戍六年，徐泗观察使崔彦曾仍以军帑空虚请再留一年。七月戍卒杀都将王仲甫，推粮料判官庞勋为首，劫库北还，经湖南、浙西入淮南；十月攻宿州、占徐州，众至数万。次年唐廷调康承训等二十万镇压，九月庞勋败死于蕲县。原线线头桂州无前置，现由「庞勋起义」事件与戍桂经过承接。路线为示意。",
          "en": "In 863 the court raised 2,000 men in Xu and Si to relieve Annam, stationing 800 of them at Guizhou on a three-year rotation. By 868 they had served six years and the governor Cui Yanzeng still asked for another year on grounds of empty coffers. In the seventh month the garrison killed commander Wang Zhongfu, chose the supply officer Pang Xun as leader, broke into the stores and marched home through Hunan, Zhexi and Huainan; in the tenth month they took Suzhou and Xuzhou and grew to tens of thousands. In the next year the court sent 200,000 men under Kang Chengxun; Pang Xun was defeated and killed at Qixian in the ninth month. The former route began at Guizhou without a precedent, now supplied by the revolt event and the garrison’s posting. The line is schematic."
        },
        "extensions": {
          "precision": "schematic"
        }
      }
